  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "This package supports both Maui apps and native apps.\n\n\t\t\tSample use and documentation:\n\t\t\thttps://github.com/vapolia/Svg-Samples\n\n\t\t\tThis library has no dependency on SkiaSharp, and uses only hardware accelerated low level platform calls.\n\t\t\tIt is fast, small, and reliable.\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tIt does not support SVG masks: make sure you save your SVGs as optimized (see documentation on github) so masks are transformed into simple paths.\n\t\t\tIt does not support text rendering, nor non-vector bitmaps.\n\n\t\t\tCommercial support is available at https://vapolia.eu\n\n\t\t\t,----,\n\t\t\t,/   .`|\n\t\t\t,`   .'  :  ,---,                                  ,-.\n\t\t\t;    ;     /,--.' |                              ,--/ /|                 ,---,\n\t\t\t.'___,/    ,' |  |  :                      ,---, ,--. :/ |                /_ ./|   ,---.           ,--,\n\t\t\t|    :     |  :  :  :                  ,-+-. /  |:  : ' /           ,---, |  ' :  '   ,'\\        ,'_ /|\n\t\t\t;    |.';  ;  :  |  |,--.  ,--.--.    ,--.'|'   ||  '  /           /___/ \\.  : | /   /   |  .--. |  | :\n\t\t\t`----'  |  |  |  :  '   | /       \\  |   |  ,\"' |'  |  :            .  \\  \\ ,' '.   ; ,. :,'_ /| :  . |\n\t\t\t'   :  ;  |  |   /' :.--.  .-. | |   | /  | ||  |   \\            \\  ;  `  ,''   | |: :|  ' | |  . .\n\t\t\t|   |  '  '  :  | | | \\__\\/: . . |   | |  | |'  : |. \\            \\  \\    ' '   | .; :|  | ' |  | |\n\t\t\t'   :  |  |  |  ' | : ,\" .--.; | |   | |  |/ |  | ' \\ \\            '  \\   | |   :    |:  | : ;  ; |\n\t\t\t;   |.'   |  :  :_:,'/  /  ,.  | |   | |--'  '  : |--'              \\  ;  ;  \\   \\  / '  :  `--'   \\\n\t\t\t'---'     |  | ,'   ;  :   .'   \\|   |/      ;  |,'                  :  \\  \\  `----'  :  ,      .-./\n\t\t\t`--''     |  ,     .-./'---'       '--'                     \\  ' ;           `--`----'\n\t\t\t`--`---'                                          `--`\n\n            1.0.8\n            This release focus on getting a stable, fully featured Windows version.\n            Changes:\n            \n            DisconnectHandler was explicitely called on Unload, this is not necessary with net9 and triggers issues on Windows. Removed.\n            \n            Windows support:\n            - all gradients are supported\n            - SvgImageSource is supported\n            \n            Known issues on Windows:\n            - delay loaded icons in list items don't appear until the page is \"refreshed\". A workaround is to set IsLoadAsync to false.\n            - calStripes.svg appears with an incorrect frame, in specific conditions to be determined. The demo projects triggers that issue when that svg is not the 1st one loaded.\n            \n\t\t\t1.0.7\n\t\t\tA gradient referenced with: url(\"#id\") (with double quotes) is now correctly applied on all platforms.\n\t\t\tiOS is now drawing gradients in strokes. They were missing.\n\t\t\tiOS now correctly draws the stroke, even if a gradient was set previously in fill, and fill is explicitly set to none.\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t1.0.6\n\t\t\tnet9 only. Use 1.0.5 for net8 support.\n\t\t\tupdate nugets\n\t\t\tlinecaps are now correct on all platforms, they were mixed up\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t1.0.5\n\t\t\tupdate nugets\n\t\t\tMinimum android version is now API 23 (was API 21)\n\n\t\t\t1.0.4\n\t\t\tmaui: fix crash when infinite space is available. fix invisible crash on android when used in tab's icons.\n\t\t\tBreaking change: FillMode is renamed Aspect to align with maui names and make the discovery of that property easier\n\t\t\tBreaking change: measurement was reworked on maui so it now obeys more intuitively to HorizontalAligment, VerticalAligment and Aspect\n\t\t\tUpdate maui version\n\t\t\tRemove dependency on Maui Compatibility\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t1.0.2\n\t\t\tFix crash on Android when the handler is disconnected\n\n\t\t\t1.0.1\n\t\t\tInitial Maui release.\n\t\t\tSee the Vapolia.Xamarin.Svg.Forms and Vapolia.Xamarin.Svg packages for the legacy Xamarin versions.",
  "repository": "",
